.TH STEREO-CREATE 1 "2026-10-14" "stereo-create 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
stereo-create \- make stereo pictures and videos in other stereo formats
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stereo-create
.B \-\-to
.I target
.RB [ \-\-quality
.IR 1-100 ]
.RB [ \-\-time
.IR seconds ]
.RB [ \-\-lossless\-anaglyph ]
.RB [ \-\-no\-notification ]
.I files...
.br
.B stereo-create \-\-probe
.I files...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stereo-create
makes new files from stereo pictures and videos, next to each source, never replacing a file.
A file is taken for stereo as the shared stereo layer decides: a mark, a stereo format or the shape rule, with the user's swap-eyes correction kept with the file.
The files of one run are one job in the notification area, with progress and cancel.
It is what "Create Stereo" in the context menu of stereo files runs.
.SH TARGETS
.TP
.B proof
the MPO and the red/cyan anaglyph
.TP
.BR mpo ", " jps ", " sbs\-png ", " pns
MPO (CIPA DC-007), JPS (cross view, with the JPS descriptor), PNG side by side and PNS (with the PNG sTER chunk)
.TP
.BR anaglyph\-red\-cyan ", " anaglyph\-red\-cyan\-crt ", " anaglyph\-green\-magenta ", " anaglyph\-amber\-blue
Dubois anaglyphs, mixed in linear light
.TP
.BR video\-full\-sbs ", " video\-half\-sbs ", " video\-top\-bottom
Matroska with StereoMode and the frame packing SEI
.TP
.B video\-mp4
MP4, full side by side, with the frame packing SEI and the st3d box
.TP
.B video\-anaglyph
Matroska, Dubois red/cyan
.TP
.BR frame\-mpo ", " frame\-jps ", " frame\-anaglyph
a frame of a video as a picture target
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-to " target"
what to make
.TP
.BI \-\-quality " n"
JPEG quality, 1 to 100 (default 92)
.TP
.BI \-\-time " seconds"
the time of a frame grab (default: a third of the video)
.TP
.B \-\-lossless\-anaglyph
write anaglyphs as PNG
.TP
.B \-\-no\-notification
do not show the job in the notification area
.TP
.B \-\-probe
only print how each file is taken: stereo or flat, the packing, the eye order and where that came from
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when every file was made, 2 when a file failed, 3 when the job was cancelled.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR mkvpropedit (1)
